WEBVTT

00:03.500 --> 00:06.790
Perhaps today's observation will only take half a day.

00:07.040 --> 00:07.830
I agree.

00:09.170 --> 00:13.960
Please make sure you absolutely
do not stray from the lands around the castle.

00:14.790 --> 00:18.880
We have yet to catch the one responsible
for that bombing back then...

00:22.500 --> 00:23.580
It's all right.

00:24.290 --> 00:26.580
The investigations are ongoing, right?

00:26.920 --> 00:34.460
Of course. However, just as Arthur's said,
please don't go anywhere you can't be seen.

00:35.170 --> 00:36.710
We won't. Right?

00:37.000 --> 00:37.750
Right!

00:40.960 --> 00:41.670
What's that?!

00:46.710 --> 00:48.170
Eh, Val?!

00:50.710 --> 00:51.670
Yep, it's me.

00:54.710 --> 00:56.790
You're already done with your deliveries?

00:57.460 --> 01:01.630
A round trip the distance of the Hawthorn Kingdom
takes five days even by carriage,

01:01.920 --> 01:04.790
and you all set out yesterday...

01:04.790 --> 01:08.330
We delivered it yesterday, and this morning
we received it and came back.

01:08.960 --> 01:12.170
You're the one who said, "The sooner the better," yeah?

01:12.460 --> 01:13.880
That is true, but...

01:14.290 --> 01:15.880
The letter is authentic.

01:17.040 --> 01:17.790
Tch...

01:18.420 --> 01:21.130
Unbelievable, that was super fast!

01:21.540 --> 01:26.580
Yeah! When we left the country, we arrived
at Hawthorn Kingdom in the blink of an eye!

01:26.920 --> 01:29.420
That's because we suddenly went really fast.

01:29.420 --> 01:32.630
We couldn't even enjoy the scenery
we never get to see at all.

01:33.040 --> 01:34.830
Thank you so much for doing that.

01:34.830 --> 01:38.420
This is after I reported the detailed
arrangement to my mother, but...

01:39.290 --> 01:39.960
Val.

01:40.920 --> 01:42.790
Sefec, Kemet.

01:44.210 --> 01:49.580
Starting today, the three of you will be
the royal family's exclusive carriers!

03:26.130 --> 03:28.000
She said we're exclusive to the royal family!

03:28.000 --> 03:29.040
Hooray!

03:30.880 --> 03:31.880
You sure about this?

03:32.080 --> 03:35.170
You sure the queen wants to use
someone with a criminal record like me?

03:35.790 --> 03:39.750
<b>"The Treacherous Princess Faces the Future"</b>

03:35.880 --> 03:39.460
As one of the joint policies in an alliance
with neighboring countries,

03:39.960 --> 03:43.040
we're thinking of creating an institution called a "school."

03:44.460 --> 03:45.380
School?

03:46.040 --> 03:52.830
Yes. There, you are guaranteed a certain level of
education, and an equal livelihood for a small child.

03:53.420 --> 03:54.500
Oh?

03:54.750 --> 03:59.540
I don't get it, but could we live an even
more fun life than we do now with Val?

04:00.290 --> 04:01.170
You could!

04:02.170 --> 04:04.790
If you all become delivery people,

04:04.790 --> 04:09.670
the consultations with each country for
the establishing the school should go smoothly.

04:10.420 --> 04:13.210
But this isn't an order.

04:13.920 --> 04:17.420
If you decline the offer, we'll carry on as
if this conversation never happened.

04:17.420 --> 04:18.540
We'll do it.

04:18.960 --> 04:19.630
Huh?

04:20.000 --> 04:22.000
It pays better than picking up debris.

04:23.420 --> 04:24.380
Are you sure?

04:25.250 --> 04:28.380
Hey now, you're the one who proposed this.

04:30.420 --> 04:33.710
You getting cold feet now, Princess?

04:37.670 --> 04:40.080
You can give any orders that you'd like.

04:42.500 --> 04:44.000
Val?! What are you...?!

04:44.330 --> 04:48.000
At any rate, I'm your servant.

04:52.880 --> 04:56.330
All of this is done according to
First Princess Pride's desires.

05:12.210 --> 05:14.080
Huh... did he just...?

05:14.880 --> 05:17.080
He... licked...

05:18.920 --> 05:20.080
Are you all right?!

05:22.500 --> 05:25.330
My bad. Don't get angry, Princess.

05:25.670 --> 05:31.330
I can't do that sort of thing or
cause you harm due to the contract.

05:33.830 --> 05:36.460
Well, just wanted to give you a quick greeting.

05:36.880 --> 05:40.210
Looking forward to working with you... "Master."

05:42.830 --> 05:43.790
Big Sister...

05:44.170 --> 05:45.500
I'm fine.

05:50.130 --> 05:52.670
Now, hand over my compensation, and make it quick.

05:55.630 --> 05:57.960
I'll go get it from the palace.

05:58.380 --> 06:01.830
Elder Sister, there's no need to
go out of your way to get it right now.

06:02.080 --> 06:04.500
They just have to wait until
we're home from the observation.

06:05.250 --> 06:07.710
Are you being lax because this is a test?

06:08.460 --> 06:13.670
Unfortunately, we're flat broke.
And it's a whole other story if I can't get any booze.

06:14.420 --> 06:15.710
It's okay, Stale.

06:16.000 --> 06:20.630
Either way, I'd like to inform Mother and
everyone about the correspondence quickly.

06:21.000 --> 06:21.830
Big Brother...

06:23.250 --> 06:26.880
You'll just say it and come back. It'll be over quick.

06:28.750 --> 06:31.080
If this is what First Princess Pride wishes to do...

06:32.330 --> 06:33.130
Goodbye.

06:36.580 --> 06:37.630
What's this?

06:38.130 --> 06:42.250
Looks like the royal prince is
quite the handful for Master, eh?

07:00.170 --> 07:03.830
Thanks, Stale. You're my prince!

07:07.290 --> 07:08.580
Say, Master.

07:09.670 --> 07:11.710
How's that any better than these kids?

07:11.880 --> 07:14.710
If it were me, I'd teach them all sorts of things.

07:15.040 --> 07:19.830
They'd learn everything they don't know yet,
from start to finish.

07:20.380 --> 07:21.920
If you need, I can even start tonight.

07:21.920 --> 07:22.790
Hey you!

07:23.790 --> 07:26.380
What the hell are you saying to Princess Pride?!

07:27.290 --> 07:28.540
You sure are young.

07:28.790 --> 07:31.210
You want in on this too?

07:31.830 --> 07:34.580
Please stop putting strange ideas into Arthur's head!

07:36.880 --> 07:41.330
Arthur is the perfect knight,
who is serious, kind, and proud!

07:42.250 --> 07:48.000
I am delighted and pleased just
to have Arthur next to me, so no thank you!

07:49.130 --> 07:53.670
You'd have a hundred times
more fun with me than with these kids.

07:54.750 --> 07:58.880
I told you, I'm fine! I have fun now!

07:59.250 --> 08:00.580
Well, that's great.

08:01.830 --> 08:03.330
Let's go to the palace!

08:07.920 --> 08:08.750
Master.

08:15.630 --> 08:17.210
I'm looking forward to it.

08:18.290 --> 08:22.170
When this "school" is done, let my kids join it.

08:25.710 --> 08:27.500
Sure, of course!

08:41.670 --> 08:43.540
Magnificently done, Sir Arthur.

08:44.000 --> 08:46.500
Your skill in falling safely is brilliant,
no matter how many times I see it.

08:47.500 --> 08:51.830
Arthur, hurry and end this. Get Gilbert on the ground.

08:54.630 --> 08:58.330
Sorry, Chancellor Gilbert! Let's have one more go!

08:59.380 --> 09:01.420
Certainly, we'll go on as long as you like!

09:02.790 --> 09:05.080
Having to do this with Gilbert, of all people...

09:12.960 --> 09:17.830
And how about you, Prince Stale?
This may be a good chance to get a hit on me.

09:18.540 --> 09:23.960
Tempting, but I'll have to decline.
I'd rather die than go hand-to-hand with you.

09:26.630 --> 09:28.040
One more time, please!

09:35.500 --> 09:38.330
Shall we make it a challenge?

09:39.040 --> 09:39.880
Eh?

09:39.880 --> 09:41.710
Let us have a mock battle next.

09:42.210 --> 09:51.080
If you can land a single strike on me, though it is
a little hasty, I will instruct you on how to do...

09:52.250 --> 09:54.420
"That technique" from earlier.

09:54.960 --> 09:56.040
Are you serious?!

09:57.210 --> 09:58.420
"That technique"?

09:58.420 --> 10:04.630
In a previous bout, there was a palm strike
that left Arthur unconscious but without injury.

10:05.290 --> 10:10.540
At that time, he said that he wouldn't teach it
without mastering another martial art first.

10:10.540 --> 10:12.330
Such an amazing technique exists?

10:13.460 --> 10:16.960
I can use any method for the mock battle, right?

10:19.500 --> 10:23.040
Feel free to use anything you'd like as long
as it is not weapon- or special ability-based.

10:28.210 --> 10:29.130
That's fine.

10:34.670 --> 10:38.500
We'll fight together, Arthur.
The two of us can beat Gilbert down.

10:39.040 --> 10:40.920
No, that's unfair.

10:41.250 --> 10:44.830
I mean, just one strike is okay,
we don't need to beat him down.

10:44.830 --> 10:45.830
I'll allow it.

10:45.830 --> 10:46.670
Eh?

10:54.170 --> 10:56.750
Everyone do your best!

10:56.750 --> 10:58.420
Just don't get hurt!

11:08.330 --> 11:09.330
Incredible...

11:16.170 --> 11:19.460
Hey, Master. What kind of game is this?

11:21.670 --> 11:23.750
Have you already completed your delivery?

11:24.330 --> 11:27.080
You should have been asked to
do three countries this time around.

11:27.460 --> 11:30.670
Yeah. But more importantly, what's going on here?

11:31.210 --> 11:35.080
Have those monsters finally started competing for you?

11:35.290 --> 11:36.790
Of course not.

11:37.750 --> 11:41.130
Pride! Be careful and don't get close to that man!

11:41.250 --> 11:43.130
We are grateful for your services.

11:46.540 --> 11:52.210
Val, is it all right if I spend time with Sefec and Kemet
before you go on your next delivery?

11:52.500 --> 11:53.210
Huh?

11:53.580 --> 11:57.960
Our refreshment today is Sefec's
absolute favorite, strawberry cake!

11:57.960 --> 11:58.920
Cake?!

12:00.920 --> 12:01.830
Let's go!

12:05.130 --> 12:07.880
Val! You and Kemet come on!

12:09.830 --> 12:10.380
Coming.

12:11.710 --> 12:12.380
Huh?

12:12.380 --> 12:13.080
Eh?

12:33.670 --> 12:35.830
But he's the one that made the mistake.

12:37.210 --> 12:39.540
Their focus is elsewhere...

12:41.170 --> 12:49.210
Well, we're leaving! Big Sister, please cheer
for Big Brother and Arthur for me too!

12:49.210 --> 12:49.920
Huh?

12:50.710 --> 12:53.250
Tell them how you feel!

12:53.790 --> 12:59.080
If you do that, I think both Big Brother and
Arthur will surely feel very encouraged!

13:02.920 --> 13:07.750
Me, cheering for cute little Tiara, too?
That's far too much responsibility!

13:10.250 --> 13:13.580
Val, do you hate Master?

13:13.580 --> 13:16.290
Eh? Why're you asking me that?

13:16.630 --> 13:21.290
Because I thought that you really liked Master...

13:21.830 --> 13:22.580
What?!

13:22.960 --> 13:26.630
We have this job because of Master, and besides...

13:27.250 --> 13:29.460
Um... well...

13:29.670 --> 13:31.880
That's just the way things worked out.

13:33.250 --> 13:36.500
You're my subject, right?!

13:37.460 --> 13:38.670
Don't push me away.

13:46.500 --> 13:49.500
Val, your face is getting red, are you all right?

13:49.500 --> 13:50.750
My face is not getting red!

13:52.250 --> 13:55.040
Cheer for them... How I feel...

14:02.830 --> 14:08.330
Stand up, Stale! Arthur!

14:09.040 --> 14:11.960
Stale, Tiara takes pride in having you as an older brother!

14:12.250 --> 14:14.880
And I take pride in having you as a younger brother!

14:15.210 --> 14:19.920
You're extremely smart and cool and
you can do anything because of that!

14:20.500 --> 14:23.710
Arthur, you are such a spectacular knight.

14:24.250 --> 14:30.710
You're strong and gallant, you've protected me
so many times you can surely beat anyone!

14:38.790 --> 14:44.460
I believe that together, you two can win!

14:53.960 --> 14:54.880
What's this?

15:04.250 --> 15:09.380
I see. If Princess Pride is what is
disturbing their concentration...

15:10.500 --> 15:15.790
it is also Princess Pride who can draw
their capabilities out to their limits.

15:17.170 --> 15:19.420
You can do it!

15:22.170 --> 15:24.250
I'd expect nothing less from Princess Pride.

15:37.040 --> 15:38.920
We managed to win, though.

15:39.880 --> 15:41.460
You're totally worn out, eh?

15:42.790 --> 15:44.210
So are you.

15:45.040 --> 15:48.710
I'll definitely be able to beat him on my own soon.

15:49.880 --> 15:56.130
Then, I'll be a knight stronger than Chancellor Gilbert...
No, I'll be stronger than everyone.

15:57.710 --> 16:00.710
It's like I can't even believe it when I say it out loud.

16:01.790 --> 16:04.330
Actually, when we were getting rid of that organization...

16:05.830 --> 16:08.290
all I could do was run away.

16:10.380 --> 16:11.790
But you...

16:18.420 --> 16:23.290
You and Princess Pride and Tiara,
I'll protect all of you together.

16:23.790 --> 16:25.790
Like I can say something so bold.

16:27.040 --> 16:29.000
In the end, I haven't changed at a-

16:29.000 --> 16:30.630
Lift your head, Arthur.

16:33.210 --> 16:37.170
You of all people should never
lower your face in front of me.

16:38.000 --> 16:43.630
It's natural that I would protect Elder Sister.
Moreover, I should be the one apologizing.

16:44.750 --> 16:49.670
Because I lost consciousness,
I exposed you and Elder Sister to danger.

16:49.670 --> 16:52.170
No, there was nothing you could have done.

16:52.580 --> 16:55.540
You saved a special ability user while you were gone.

16:56.040 --> 16:58.630
Then there was nothing
you could have done either, right?

16:59.460 --> 17:04.420
You couldn't see anything due to the smoke and bombs
when Elder Sister jumped in after Val.

17:04.670 --> 17:09.710
I'm telling you! I should have been
with Princess Pride when the bombs fell!

17:10.210 --> 17:12.210
I heard it straight from Elder Sister.

17:12.920 --> 17:16.130
While I was gone, I know just what you did.

17:16.710 --> 17:22.880
You helped Gilbert and I by wielding your sword,
and you put your life on the line to protect Elder Sister.

17:23.750 --> 17:27.040
You successfully protected me and her.

17:28.790 --> 17:33.000
Even right before I lost consciousness,
I felt relieved knowing that you were there.

17:34.500 --> 17:37.830
That's because I believed that
you would protect Elder Sister.

17:40.000 --> 17:46.420
This time by chance, I just ended up being the one
who could rush to Elder Sister's predicament.

17:48.330 --> 17:51.380
What do you think, Arthur? Glad I'm here, right?

17:56.960 --> 17:59.040
Yeah, I am!

18:02.630 --> 18:04.290
Now I've made good on my promise.

18:09.290 --> 18:13.880
Back then, all I could do was watch pathetically.

18:15.080 --> 18:16.000
But...

18:25.630 --> 18:26.790
This is the best!

18:31.000 --> 18:33.330
Stale! Arthur!

18:34.960 --> 18:38.580
You both did so well!
I went to dampen the handkerchiefs.

18:44.580 --> 18:46.330
You were so amazing, Arthur.

18:46.790 --> 18:51.500
It's truly an impressive thing to beat Chancellor Gilbert.

18:52.380 --> 18:54.040
I couldn't help but be captivated!

18:57.960 --> 19:01.750
You too Stale, you've grown into a magnificent boy.

19:02.250 --> 19:03.170
Pride...

19:03.630 --> 19:07.130
Stay still. I can't get the dirt off of you.

19:10.540 --> 19:11.920
I remember...

19:12.790 --> 19:20.040
That day I made the resolution.
I swore I'd protect Elder Sister... Pride.

19:23.170 --> 19:25.290
As long as I can protect Pride, everything is fine.

19:25.920 --> 19:27.920
That's what I've always thought...

19:29.540 --> 19:32.920
With this special ability... that I didn't even ask for!

19:33.380 --> 19:37.210
What's so wrong with wishing to simply continue living?!

19:43.250 --> 19:45.080
Pride, I...

19:46.170 --> 19:54.040
I'm not doing this only for you, but I want to
become a much, much more respectable regent!

19:56.170 --> 19:59.000
You can, I have absolutely no doubt about that.

19:59.670 --> 20:03.330
After all, you are my younger brother,
who I am so proud of.

20:12.080 --> 20:15.460
The two of you have truly
become such admirable people.

20:17.540 --> 20:25.000
I am genuinely happy we met.
I'm so glad that you two are by my side.

20:27.420 --> 20:31.290
Protect the people, and Tiara.

20:32.330 --> 20:35.500
I know the two of you can do that.

20:46.880 --> 20:48.500
We will also protect you!

20:51.830 --> 20:53.250
Please rely on us more.

20:53.830 --> 20:57.830
We will protect Tiara, the people, and you!

20:58.880 --> 21:03.710
I will never change. I will continue
to keep the oath I made that day.

21:05.500 --> 21:10.880
Since I became a royal guard,
I am truly your knight in every way!

21:11.790 --> 21:14.500
Arthur... Stale...

21:17.670 --> 21:20.170
The both of you are marvelous!

22:12.380 --> 22:14.250
How many mornings have passed since then?

22:59.880 --> 23:06.750
There have been so many encounters.
No, there will be many encounters in the future.

23:09.540 --> 23:10.380
And...

23:11.630 --> 23:18.580
Pride Royal Ivy will cause the collapse of
this country as the most diabolical last boss.

23:25.420 --> 23:27.250
I still have time.

23:29.000 --> 23:33.920
For the sake of the beautiful Kingdom of Freesia,
and it's people that I should love,

23:34.380 --> 23:39.170
as queen, I will do what I can.
